# quest steps re-cut from the earlier Questwarden routes by tools/research/zone_order.py.

@guide H_24_ShimmeringFlats
@name Shimmering Flats (31-32)
@faction Horde
@levels 31-32
@zone Thousand Needles
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Shimmering Flats, visit 3 of 4 on the Horde route, levels 31-32.
@next H_25_Desolace

note [class=Warrior,Shaman,Warlock] | Level 30 class quests. The zeppelin from Grom'gol lands outside Orgrimmar: stop in the city first.
travel Orgrimmar [class=Warrior,Shaman]
accept 1718 The Islander [class=Warrior; race=Orc,Undead,Tauren,Troll] | Sorek, Valley of Honor, Orgrimmar. Needs level 30.
accept 1531 Call of Air [class=Shaman] | Searn Firewarder, Valley of Wisdom. Needs level 30.
travel Thousand Needles
turnin 1531 Call of Air [class=Shaman] | Prate Cloudseer, Thousand Needles.
turnin 1536 Call of Water [class=Shaman] | Brine, Southern Barrens, north of the Great Lift.
accept 1534 Call of Water [class=Shaman]
complete 1534 Call of Water [class=Shaman] | Fill the Empty Blue Waterskin at the Ruins of Stardust in Ashenvale (fly to Splintertree Post).
turnin 1534 Call of Water [class=Shaman] | Back to Brine.
accept 220 Call of Water [class=Shaman]
turnin 220 Call of Water [class=Shaman] | Islen Waterseer, north of Ratchet.
accept 63 Call of Water [class=Shaman] | The last part is in Silverpine Forest; the guide gets there at 37.
accept 1102 A Vengeful Fate [dungeon=Razorfen Kraul]
complete 1102 A Vengeful Fate [dungeon=Razorfen Kraul]
turnin 1102 A Vengeful Fate [dungeon=Razorfen Kraul]
turnin 1718 The Islander [class=Warrior; race=Orc,Undead,Tauren,Troll] | Klannoc Macleod, Fray Island, off the Barrens coast.
accept 1719 The Affray [class=Warrior; race=Orc,Undead,Tauren,Troll]
complete 1719 The Affray [class=Warrior; race=Orc,Undead,Tauren,Troll]
turnin 1719 The Affray [class=Warrior; race=Orc,Undead,Tauren,Troll] | Berserker Stance.
accept 1145 The Swarm Grows
accept 1362 The Kolkar of Desolace
turnin 1145 The Swarm Grows [class=Warrior; race=Orc,Undead,Tauren,Troll] | Turned in at Orgrimmar.
turnin 1145 The Swarm Grows [class=Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock; race=Undead] | Turned in at Orgrimmar.
turnin 1145 The Swarm Grows [class=Hunter,Rogue,Shaman,Warlock; race=Orc] | Turned in at Orgrimmar.
turnin 1145 The Swarm Grows [class=Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage; race=Troll] | Turned in at Orgrimmar.
turnin 1145 The Swarm Grows [class=Hunter,Shaman,Druid; race=Tauren] | Turned in at Orgrimmar.
note [class=Warlock] | Felhunter chain: Ratchet, the Undercity, Hillsbrad and back. It is long; the guide finishes it at 37.
accept 1801 Tome of the Cabal [class=Warlock] | Strahad Farsan, Ratchet. Needs level 30.
travel Undercity [class=Warlock] | Zeppelin from outside Orgrimmar.
turnin 1801 Tome of the Cabal [class=Warlock] | Jorah Annison, Undercity.
accept 1803 Tome of the Cabal [class=Warlock]
complete 1803 Tome of the Cabal [class=Warlock; obj=1] | Moldy Tome: in Hillsbrad Foothills (fly to Tarren Mill).
travel Thousand Needles [class=Warlock] | Zeppelin back to Durotar, then fly to Freewind Post.
complete 1803 Tome of the Cabal [class=Warlock] | Tattered Manuscript: a Damaged Chest in Thousand Needles.
accept 1175 A Bump in the Road | Trackmaster Zherin.
complete 1175 A Bump in the Road | Saltstone basilisks.
turnin 1175 A Bump in the Road
accept 1110 Rocket Car Parts | Kravel Koalbeard.
complete 1110 Rocket Car Parts | Parts scattered on the flats.
turnin 1110 Rocket Car Parts
level 32 | Desolace starts at 32. If you are lower, kill what is around you here (or run a dungeon) until you reach it.
